## Known Issues
- Struct size mismatch: publisher heartbeat (40 bytes) vs BPF health_state (56 bytes)
  → BPF reads uninitialized fields at offsets 40-55 of heartbeat packet
  → Fix required: either extend heartbeat or pad health_state access in BPF
- No GitHub remote configured → push to canonical branch blocked
  → Branch feature/bpf-reconstruction-v2 exists locally, ready for push once remote is set
- wg_ingress/resource_ingress use pkey={0,0,0,0} placeholder — needs real peer extraction from packet headers

